            <ArticleTitle>Hyaluronan in adipose tissue: Beyond dermal filler and therapeutic carrier.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>323ps4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1126/scitranslmed.aad6793</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Adipose hyaluronan is increasingly recognized as an active player in adipose tissue fibrosis and metabolic dysfunction. However, this role poses as many challenges as opportunities for therapeutic targeting of adipose tissue dysfunction during nutrient oversupply.</AbstractText>
